  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Fakkeenyi koodii, Sikeemaaleen JSON, fi maadheelee imaammataa kan meeshaan dubbifamu, kan biraa yoo ibsamu baatee, Hayyama MIT jalatti hayyamamaniiru. Marsariitii keessan irratti bilisaan itti fayyadamuu ni dandeessu.",
