  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Erga Waltajjii Nageenya AI Bletchley booda ajajamee, kan Yoshua Bengio geggeessu, ogeeyyii 100 ol biyyoota 30 ta'an irraa fi UN, OECD, fi Gamtaa Awrooppaa irraa gumaachan waliin, gabaasni walaba kun ragaa saayinsii yeroo ammaa dandeettii fi balaa AI daangaa irratti jiru walitti qaba — kan agarsiisu sirnoonni tokko tokko amma yeroo madaalaman adda baasuu fi sanaan amala isaanii sirreeffachuu akka danda'an.",
