  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Sadarkaa sirrii: wixinee qorannoo walabaa, yaada protokoolii, fi yaalii ibsa banaa.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Dogoggora dur ture sirreesse: Beeljiyeem (BE) amma gara Dach mata (Dutch) geeddarama, Faransaayii mannaa — dubbattoonni Fleemish baayyina biyyattii (%60 tahan) dubbattoota Faransaayii Waaloonii (%40) ol qabu.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Dogoggora dur ture sirreesse: Kaazaakistaan (KZ) amma gara afaan Kaazaakii geeddarama, Ruushiyaa mannaa, erga hiikni Kaazaakii jiraatee — gosuma sirreeffama Beeljiyeem duraa waliin wal fakkaata.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
  "Crawler access rules": "Seera Dhaqqabiinsa Crawler",
