  "Custom tier": "Sadarkaa Ofii-Tolfamaa",
  "Daily Nous reports on a retracted Journal of Medical Ethics submission containing multiple fabricated, AI-hallucinated references — complete with fake university affiliations and defunct email addresses — that the author reportedly left uncorrected even after being given a chance to fix proofs. The piece contrasts this with Bioethics, whose automated reference-checking would have caught the problem, and argues the real bottleneck isn't detection technology (one commenter's script flagged the fake citations in under a minute) but unpaid reviewer labor and publishing incentives that reward throughput over scrutiny.": "Daily Nous gabaasa waa'ee galmee Journal of Medical Ethics kan haqame kan caqasawwan sobaa, AI-n uumaman hedduu of-keessaa qabu — waliin walqabaatii yuunivarsiitii sobaa fi imeelii hin jiraanne — kan barreessaan sirreessuu utuu carraa argatee illee sirreessuu dide jedhame gabaafame. Barreeffamichi kana Bioethics waliin walbira qabee ilaala, kan sakatta'iinsa caqasaa ofumaan hojjetu rakkoo sana argachuu danda'u ture, akkasumas rakkoon dhugaa teeknooloojii argannoo utuu hin taane hojii gamaaggamtootaa kaffaltii hin qabne fi kakaasa maxxansaa kan bahaa qabxii hordoffii caalaa jajjabeessu jedhe falma.",
  "Data free-riding vs. trillion-dollar AI valuations": "Daataa gantummaan fayyadamuu fi gatii AI triiliyoona dollaraa gidduu",
  "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI": "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI",
  "Demis Hassabis proposed a FINRA-style regulator for frontier model releases: labs would submit models for review up to 30 days before deployment, voluntary at first, with a path toward mandatory compliance in the US market.": "Demis Hassabis to'attuu FINRA-fakkaattu, kan gadhiisiinsa moodeelota daangaa ilaalu ni yaade: kutaaleen moodeelota gaafii guyyaa 30 dura gadhiisuun dura gamaaggamaaf ni dhiyeessu, jalqaba irratti fedhiin, gara dirqama gabaa Ameerikaa keessatti raawwatamuutti karaa qabatee.",
  "Denied": "Dhorkame",
  "Deployable policy starter template": "Maadhee Jalqabaa Imaammataa Hojiirra Oolchuuf",
  "Deployable policy starter template at /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — a minimal static site with the full machine-readable layer, ready for Cloudflare Pages or any static host.": "Maadhee jalqabaa imaammataa kan /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip irratti argamu — marsariitii dhaabbataa xiqqaa sadarkaa meeshaan dubbifamu guutuu qabu, Cloudflare Pages ykn iddoo tajaajilaa dhaabbataa kamiif iyyuu qophaa'e.",
  "Deploying machine-readable policies on your site": "Imaammata Kan Meeshaan Dubbifamu Marsariitii Keessan Irratti Hojiirra Oolchuu",
  "Disclaimer": "Ibsa Itti Gaafatamummaa",
  "Distinct from human UI, SEO, or plain APIs, the AI Ingestion & Capability Layer gives websites a machine-facing architecture: a Manifest Layer (entry points like /llms.txt and /ai/manifest.json), a Corpus Layer (machine-readable knowledge), a Capability Layer (agent-callable tools), and a Governance Layer (provenance, licensing, versioning). Static-first, upgradeable toward APIs and MCP. Note: in this paper AICL names the ingestion architecture; on this site's protocol pages AICL refers to the AI Content Licensing Layer.": "Sadarkaan Fudhannaa fi Dandeettii AI, UI namootaa, SEO, ykn API salphaa irraa adda ta'ee, weebsaayitiiwwaniif ijaarsa AI-tti garagalu ni kenna: Sadarkaa Labsii (karrawwan seenaa akka /llms.txt fi /ai/manifest.json), Sadarkaa Kuusaa (beekumsa kan meeshaan dubbifamu), Sadarkaa Dandeettii (meeshaalee eejjentiin waaman), fi Sadarkaa Bulchiinsaa (madda seenaa, hayyama, fooyya'iinsa). Dhaabbataadhaan jalqaba, gara API fi MCP-tti fooyya'uu danda'a. Yaadannoo: barreeffama kana keessatti AICL ijaarsa fudhannaa maqeessa; fuula protokoolii marsariitii kanaa irratti garuu AICL Sadarkaa Hayyama Qabiyyee AI agaza.",
