  "Educational demo: HMAC-SHA256 with a shared secret, showing request-bound, expiring, verifiable license tokens. Production tokens should be signed asymmetrically, with the publisher’s public key discoverable under /.well-known/.": "Fakkeenya barnootaa: HMAC-SHA256 icciitii wal-qooddatamu waliin, kan tookinota hayyamaa gaaffii waliin walqabatan, kan yeroo dhumu, kan mirkanaa'an agarsiisu. Tookinonni oomishaa mallattoo walqixa hin taane qabaachuu qabu, furtuu ummataa maxxansaa /.well-known/ jalatti argamuu danda'uun.",
  "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Galmeewwan /topics saddeet dabalataa, kan yeroo kanaa eejjentii AI-tiin qoratame, harka-tolfamaan filatamuu mannaa — seera dursaa wal fakkaatu: maddi hundi fudhatamee jiraataa isaa mirkanaa'ee, cuunfaan haaraa dubbannee, utuu wanti tokko hin dabalamin dura. Waliigalatti galmee 14.",
