  "Video and audio companions to the protocols and papers — the AI rights layer, watchable and listenable.": "Wal-simattoota viidiyoo fi sagalee protokoolii fi barreeffamootaaf — sadarkaan mirga AI, ilaalamuu fi dhaga'amuu danda'u.",
  "Videos": "Viidiyoowwan",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "Faayilii imaammataa keessan uumuu barbaaddu?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Fontiin weebii Google Fonts irraa fe'amu, kan gaaffii fontii dhaabbataa barouzarii keessan irraa fudhatu. Sagantaan namoota sadaffaa biraa hin fayyadamamu.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Waan sirnoonni AI qabiyyee irratti gochuu danda'an: dubbisuu, cuunfuu, geeddaruu, walitti qabuu, leenjii, daldalaan fayyadamuu, raabsuu. Ulaagaan AICR fi sadarkaan hayyama AICL mirgoota kana labsamuu fi daldalamuu danda'an taasisu.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Waan gabatee-tajaajilaa deebisuu danda'u yeroo crawler AI qabiyyee hayyamame, tookina hayyamaa malee, gaafatu — gaaffii gatii meeshaan hojjechuu danda'u, dhuma-du'aa mannaa.",
  "What this site is": "Marsariitiin Kun Maal Akka Ta'e",
  "What this site is not": "Marsariitiin Kun Maal Akka Hin Taane",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "AI baruu danda'aa, hanga hammamitti, kaayyoo kamiif, fi dirqama akkamii jalatti. Dubbifamuun barnoota irraa argachuu miti; \"hin dhorkamne\" jechuun \"baratamaa\" jechuu miti. AIRS fi AILP eeyyama baruumsaa gara hangii tartiibaa, kan meeshaan dubbifamu geeddaru.",
  "Whitepapers": "Barreeffamoota Adii",
  "Whitepapers & Docs": "Barreeffamoota Adii fi Dokumentoota",
  "Whitepapers remain English-first by design; machine-readable files stay language-neutral.": "Barreeffamoonni adii, ijaarsaan Ingiliffaa-jalqabaa ta'anii itti fufu; faayiloonni kan meeshaan dubbifamu afaan-hin-filanne ta'anii itti fufu.",
  "Who is behind it": "Eenyutu Duuba Jira",
  "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections": "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections",
  "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics": "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics",
  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Maaliif mallattoon eeyyamuu/dhorkuu tokko qofti fayyadama qabiyyee bara AI bulchuu hin dandeenye — fi sadarkaan mirgaa bakka isaa buusu maal fakkaata.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Maaliif Banaa-ta'iinsi Hin Ibsamin Adeemsawwan Leenjii Keessaa Qulqullaa'u",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Wilks, Ladak, fi Loughnan (Yuunivarsiitii Edinbaraa) mari'iin falaasamaa qalbii AI irratti jiru qorannoo saayikooloojii amala bineensotaa irratti hundaa'e akka dagatu ni falma — jal'ina yaadaa fi hawaasaa wal fakkaatu kan yaada-keessa-galchuu amala bineensotaaf daangessu, AI-fis akkasuma daangessuu danda'a, AI takkaa qalbii qabaachuu baattuyyuu.",
